<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Edited to add: The main photo above (thanks to Gabriel Dos Reis) and the additional photo below (thanks to Alan Talbot) were taken at the midweek evening social event at the Prague February 2020 ISO C++ meeting — the meeting where we finalized and shipped C++20 including Gor&#8217;s coroutine design. Within the ISO C++ committee, C++ coroutines continue to be lovingly called Gor-routines.</p>


